  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid, observable improvements in AI capabilities change strategic balances by enabling new military/intelligence and economic advantages, prompting accelerated contestation, intelligence posturing, and security coordination that raise bilateral strategic tensions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_power_shift</data>
