  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid rollout of powerful models into commercial tooling and open platforms shortens the technical barrier for adversaries and proxy groups to design, coordinate, and autonavigate swarms and guided munitions or to automate targeting of vessels, increasing the incidence of maritime attacks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_maritime</data>
</edge>
