  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Firms facing faster deployment cycles that increase operational, IP and compliance risk (including cross‑border data flows and export controls) relocate production or services to jurisdictions perceived as more stable or permissive to avoid disruption and liability.</data>
