  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in AI-related safety incidents affecting shipboard autonomous navigation, port automation, or traffic-management systems causes operators and charterers to delay, reroute, or temporarily suspend tanker movements through affected corridors, reducing transit rates.</data>
