  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened export controls, procurement restrictions and domestic rules on dual-use AI systems constrain transfer of AI-enabled targeting, surveillance and guidance software and lengthen approval processes, directly slowing and reducing deliveries of such materiel to allied partners.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
