  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in domestic or visible multinational policy pressure to constrain AI leads counterpart governments to enact their own administrative measures (export controls, screening, subsidies, or bans) to protect national security and competitiveness, increasing intervention intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
